/T (The proposed project aims to determine the optimal tilt angle and azimuth angle of a solar photovoltaic \(PV\) panel for a given geographical location in order to maximize its annual energy generation. Instead of manually testing a large number of possible panel orientations, the problem is formulated as a local-search optimization problem.)
/E (The proposed project aims to determine the optimal tilt angle and azimuth angle of a solar photovoltaic \(PV\) panel for a given geographical location in order to maximize its annual energy generation. Instead of manually testing a large number of possible panel orientations, the problem is formulated as a local-search optimization problem.)
